{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world full of monsters, fight terrifying monsters and monster bosses, challenge your way to new lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your heroes by developing skills, choose a class to join the battle against monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful and survive as long as you can in this desolate battlefield, fight until you defeat the boss in each area to enter the next new land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Legendary Heroes Survivals is a top-down platform roguelite game with a 2D solo battle mode where you fight against a large number of invading monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/d11da9c97988d486b6a0c62b6b0b6f23.poster.avif?t=1759772450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/d11da9c97988d486b6a0c62b6b0b6f23.webm?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/d11da9c97988d486b6a0c62b6b0b6f23.mp4?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Survive the challenges in each level to defeat the boss in each level, collect coins to develop your own character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock new characters, 1 star and 2 star levels (must unlock 1 star before it will show) total 15 characters to challenge higher levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/b3d741a6d13f4f30e2443dab01436ad2.poster.avif?t=1759772450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/b3d741a6d13f4f30e2443dab01436ad2.webm?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/b3d741a6d13f4f30e2443dab01436ad2.mp4?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Develop and upgrade various abilities, totaling more than 10 types, to help our characters become even more capable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/0ea95444e50847d14630b432c9a8aaa7.poster.avif?t=1759772450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/0ea95444e50847d14630b432c9a8aaa7.webm?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/0ea95444e50847d14630b432c9a8aaa7.mp4?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use special skills unique to each character to fight for survival in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenge boss level monsters with unique abilities in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/736cf674fb460f3a68f9bb25278038e2.poster.avif?t=1759772450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/736cf674fb460f3a68f9bb25278038e2.webm?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/736cf674fb460f3a68f9bb25278038e2.mp4?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rookie Hours","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566580/4592925a5a64db14c80dbeb4d4f54db0b5a09bc8.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Grind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566580/ded7e08bedeb04af6d0b8d0174145aa1430994dd.jpg"},{"name":"Eternal Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566580/75601832374228ed4a2266b5990bf5f4ad226f4c.jpg"},{"name":"Basic Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566580/9676e73720539415af05a5347f939e70cd1359ad.jpg"},{"name":"Combat Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566580/c9b36a0da9921ca5dd8ad8bebcea7983c8b4642d.jpg"},{"name":"Battle Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566580/169012b6bba556ffa856f5f7b7b99f337080e330.jpg"},{"name":"Dominion Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566580/784111c8cbbb60927a35fbc9944e911662d472e2.jpg"},{"name":"Novice ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566580/8b45c122596663033afdcbc08880c07ee52cc3bd.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566580/6a99edc00c8828a7cb95ac7add4bea088b0632b0.jpg"},{"name":"Grandmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566580/aee7d6f11a0264da20ee31a2cf630f7255dd792e.jpg"}],"total":67},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566580?t=1759772450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/92767e8f0dd7da97332050da6d5b2cfc17e839f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759772450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite