o/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Survive the challenges in each level to defeat the boss in each level, collect coins to develop your own character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock new characters, 1 star and 2 star levels (must unlock 1 star before it will show) total 15 characters to challenge higher levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/b3d741a6d13f4f30e2443dab01436ad2.poster.avif?t=1759772450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/b3d741a6d13f4f30e2443dab01436ad2.webm?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/b3d741a6d13f4f30e2443dab01436ad2.mp4?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Develop and upgrade various abilities, totaling more than 10 types, to help our characters become even more capable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/0ea95444e50847d14630b432c9a8aaa7.poster.avif?t=1759772450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/0ea95444e50847d14630b432c9a8aaa7.webm?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/0ea95444e50847d14630b432c9a8aaa7.mp4?t=1759772450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use special skills unique to each character to fight for survival in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cha